  "ruleText": "Emp 404.02 Scope. These rules shall apply to any entity for which assistance from the JTP is requested under WorkInvestNH and to any individual for which assistance from the JTP is requested under WorkNowNH.\n\nSource. #7765, eff 9-27-02; ss by #8989, eff 9-22-07, EXPIRES: 3-20-08; ss by #9092, eff 2-23-08, EXPIRED: 2-23-16\n\nNew. #12960, INTERIM, eff 12-26-19, EXPIRED: 6-23-20\n\nNew. #13074, eff 7-22-20",
